<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" modified="2026-10-09T09:22:34.464Z" agent="Codex" version="24.7.17"><diagram id="session-flow" name="Session planning flow"><mxGraphModel dx="1800" dy="1160" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1800" pageHeight="1160" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="title" value="Session Studio · planning flow" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=32;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#17243a;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="64" y="28" width="1500" height="36" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="subtitle" value="Implemented policy · Intake → editable agenda → approved handoff · Plus slots add methods or session steps" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#17243a;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="64" y="75" width="1600" height="36" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edit_title" value="FROM AGENDA REVIEW · choose an edit, then return to review" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#17243a;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="64" y="378" width="1600" height="36" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="left_title" value="INTAKE CHANGES" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#17243a;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="64" y="405" width="448" height="36" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="middle_title" value="TIMING CHANGES" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#17243a;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="405" width="448" height="36" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="right_title" value="METHOD CHANGES" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#17243a;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1056" y="405" width="680" height="36" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="intake" value="1  SESSION INTAKE  Name + optional context Phase, goal, time, participants Experience + demo mode Goal/phase advisory: change it or continue anyway." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dbe1ea;fontColor=#17243a;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="64" y="140" width="304" height="194" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="generate" value="2  MAKE PLAN  Validate intake + readiness. Match phase, goal, group, level. Add methods + session steps. If infeasible: show error; keep intake / edited plan." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dbe1ea;fontColor=#17243a;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="406" y="140" width="304" height="194" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="review" value="3  REVIEW AGENDA&#10;Expand methods + steps.&#10;Swap steps; remove + Undo.&#10;Plus slots add blocks.&#10;Other blocks stay unchanged." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;arcSize=8;fillColor=#edf2ff;strokeColor=#dbe1ea;fontColor=#17243a;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="748" y="140" width="304" height="194" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="approve" value="4  CONFIRM PLANNING  Create a deep-copy snapshot. Include accepted warnings and remaining constraints. Accepts excess time or participant mismatch." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dbe1ea;fontColor=#17243a;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1090" y="140" width="304" height="194" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="handoff" value="5  APPROVED HANDOFF  Read-only time; details expand. Download Markdown plan. Editing clears approval. Live running screen and Session Chief pending." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dbe1ea;fontColor=#17243a;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1432" y="140" width="304" height="194" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="intake_edit" value="LEFT PANEL  ·  EDIT INTAKE  Draft edits do not change the agenda. Close / Escape: discard intake draft; the current plan stays unchanged. Confirm: regenerate from changed intake. Advisory goal/phase warning allows continue." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dbe1ea;fontColor=#17243a;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="64" y="444" width="448" height="180" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="intake_return" value="RETURN TO AGENDA REVIEW  Success replaces the plan. Failure keeps current plan + shows error." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;arcSize=8;fillColor=#edf2ff;strokeColor=#dbe1ea;fontColor=#17243a;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="64" y="662" width="448" height="108" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="time_edit" value="MANUAL TIME EDIT  Method minimum = ceil(60% of default). Also allow at least 1 minute per step. Session organisation minimum = 1 minute. Whole-method edit redistributes step times. Step edit changes that step + method total. Invalid edit: error; activity stays unchanged." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dbe1ea;fontColor=#17243a;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="444" width="448" height="218" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="time_return" value="RETURN TO AGENDA REVIEW  Only edited activity / timing changes. Recalculate elapsed time and total. If over budget: total warning only. No regeneration or replacement dialog." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;arcSize=8;fillColor=#edf2ff;strokeColor=#dbe1ea;fontColor=#17243a;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="712" width="448" height="154" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="choices" value="RIGHT PANEL  ·  CHOOSE A REPLACEMENT  Novice: up to 3 eligible, easy, same-category, budget-fitting alternatives. Bachelor: up to 3 recommendations + remaining same-category records. Master: all other methods across categories; no recommendations. Every candidate expands; ready procedures include nested step details." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dbe1ea;fontColor=#17243a;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1056" y="444" width="680" height="146" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="replace" value="REPLACE BUTTON OR DRAG TO SELECTED METHOD  Ready methods only. Replace the target at its catalogue default duration. Other activities stay unchanged. Close without choosing keeps the plan." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dbe1ea;fontColor=#17243a;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1056" y="628" width="680" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="warning" value="PARTICIPANT MISMATCH OR TOTAL OVER BUDGET?  Bachelor / Master: show warning after the replacement is applied. No constraint warning (including eligible Novice choice): return to review." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;arcSize=8;fillColor=#fff6e2;strokeColor=#dbe1ea;fontColor=#17243a;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1056" y="766" width="680" height="104" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="dismiss" value="DISMISS  Retain the replacement. Record accepted warning. Return to agenda review." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;arcSize=8;fillColor=#edf2ff;strokeColor=#dbe1ea;fontColor=#17243a;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1056" y="906" width="280" height="126" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rebuild" value="REBUILD · PIN THIS METHOD  Pin chosen method; participants fixed. Available time may grow to fit. Success: new plan → review. Infeasible: error; edited plan retained." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;arcSize=8;fillColor=#edf2ff;strokeColor=#dbe1ea;fontColor=#17243a;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1370" y="906" width="366" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="catalogue" value="METHOD LIBRARY  ·  SOURCE READINESS  Ready = verified procedure + at least one step + default minutes + minimum participants + difficulty. A blank maximum means no upper limit. Incomplete records remain visible but cannot be selected. Metadata saves durably on the server and affects future plans; current durations remain unchanged. Title-only records still need recovered procedures. Demo ratings are separate, labelled estimates." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;arcSize=8;fillColor=#f9fafc;strokeColor=#dbe1ea;fontColor=#17243a;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=17;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="64" y="908" width="944" height="156" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge0" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#71839c;strokeWidth=2;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="intake" target="generate"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#71839c;strokeWidth=2;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="generate" target="review"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#71839c;strokeWidth=2;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="review" target="approve"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#71839c;strokeWidth=2;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="approve" target="handoff"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge4" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#71839c;strokeWidth=2;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="intake_edit" target="intake_return"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#71839c;strokeWidth=2;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="time_edit" target="time_return"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge6" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#71839c;strokeWidth=2;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="choices" target="replace"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge7" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#71839c;strokeWidth=2;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="replace" target="warning"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge8" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#71839c;strokeWidth=2;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="warning" target="dismiss"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge9" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#71839c;strokeWidth=2;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="warning" target="rebuild"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="footer" value="Policy source: lib/engine.ts · app/studio.tsx · PRODUCT.md · Method readiness: lib/catalogue.ts" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#17243a;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="64" y="1090" width="1640" height="36" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>